<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.75 vs   2.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.38 vs   7.55</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.76 vs   6.13</p>
<p> Sales		   60.87 vs  43.78</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
